== Dataset Research Questions <chapter:experiments:dataset>
After evaluating the approach using the dataset, the dataset itself is evaluated.
In contrast to the approach, no further research questions are posed.
The design section introduced several requirements for the dataset in @table:dataset:requirements.
Several aspects of the dataset are not applicable for evaluation, as the size of the dataset is too small and specifically crafted for evaluation of the approach.
Thus, the evaluation will use another approach. It will first shortly check if the defined requirements were met.
After checking the requirements, the evaluation will introduce some statistics about the dataset and discuss these.

In particular, it will discuss the distribution of the tasks according to their different properties, such as the date of the code change, the tasks per dependency, etc.
